# Upload scope for CLI deployments run from this directory.
#
# Production deploys are git-triggered and scoped by the project's Root
# Directory setting (`Part2_Infrastructure/web`), which makes this file
# irrelevant to them. It matters only when someone runs `vercel` by hand from
# `Part2_Infrastructure/`, where the default would be to upload the entire
# gateway — venv, DuckDB audit log, `.env` and all — to build a Next.js app.
**
!web
!web/**

# Keep local build products, dependencies, links and secrets out of uploads.
web/node_modules/**
web/.next/**
web/.vercel/**
web/.env*
!web/.env.example
web/*.tsbuildinfo
